:: Felix Hang Out Go To Park [nobr]

/* Intro */
You ask Felix if he wants to go to the park with you and he instantly lights up. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah! Like I said, always got my football on me if you fancy a game.”</span> He says, patting the bag with the soccer ball in it. <span style="Color: Yellow">You narrow your eyes at him, asking if the boy can ever think about anything other than soccer.</span> He laughs nervously in response and rubs the back of his head. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, sorry. It’s just, like, the best game. You got to admit that at least!”</span><br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Felix",
		State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
			Mouth: "Happy",
            Blush: 1,
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Happy",
		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Why is he so obsessed with soccer?<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You ask why he is so obsessed with soccer. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, firstly, it’s football.”</span> He says in a teasingly condescending way. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I try not to correct you guys when you call it soccer, but I do die a little inside every time.”</span> You roll your eyes and smirk, repeating your question using the proper name of the sport. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Uh, because it’s the greatest game ever invented? Speed, dexterity, teamwork, strategy, determination! Name another game that requires all of that!”</span> You do exactly that and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> blows a raspberry. <span style="Color: LightGreen">You get the feeling there is no changing his mind.</span><br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Felix Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Ask about his favorite team<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> what his favorite soccer team is and he stops dead in his tracks. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Trust me, you don’t want to get me started on that topic. Plus, if you knew anything about soccer, you’d already know.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> stands in such a way like he’s trying to show you something obvious, but you don’t quite understand. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“One day you’ll get it.”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">He laughs, patting you on the shoulder as he continues walking.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Felix Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
